[agent] ### Step 4: Populate `derived7b4d0b` with a SQL Query
[agent] I will use the `hops sql` command to run a SQL query that joins `rawa7b4d0b` and `rawb7b4d0b` on `row_id`, computes `col_sum = a_val + b_val`, and rounds it to 6 decimal places.
[agent:bash] hops sql --query "INSERT INTO derived7b4d0b_1 SELECT a.row_id, ROUND(a.a_val + b.b_val, 6) AS col_sum FROM rawa7b4d0b_1 a JOIN rawb7b4d0b_1 b ON a.row_id = b.row_id" --json
